Lsfh_not_stack:
# The report fields are process-wide, so they are recorded only once the fault is known not to be
# stack growth: an actor taking growth faults on another thread must not overwrite them while a fatal
# fault is being reported (spec 15.4.5.5). rsi / rdx are reloaded: the growth check made calls.
